{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "你从来都不说的人就是你想保护的人  (The Person You Never Name Is Who You Protect)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After staying up all night checking Wang Er's tip, Bu Xiaogu walks fearless into Chun Yuqiao's office and asks the one question nobody else has thought to ask: where is the reclusive songwriter hiding? Listen to Xiaogu, Kaiwen, and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在倒是在，你要不怕死的话，你就进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我什么时候怕死过？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您知道钟阳子这个人在哪儿吗？我昨晚查了一宿，网上没有她的任何信息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "据我所知，她和白石公司的合约没有任何法律效力，如果她不出来主张权利，咱们就没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这事你是从哪儿知道的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我自有我的方法，我们这些小员工也不是白痴啊！钟阳子对于这件事情的解决至关重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你为什么会觉得我知道她在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你就是知道！这件事情发生了这么久，你从来都不说的人，就是你想保护的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我私人去找她，不会有那么多媒体关注到我。我发誓不会伤害到任何人，你相信我！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在有空吗？能不能陪我去趟日本？那就在我们家门口见！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is Mr Chun Yu in his office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在倒是在，你要不怕死的话，你就进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He's inside, alright — if you aren't afraid of dying, go right on in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我什么时候怕死过？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since when have I ever been afraid of dying?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您知道钟阳子这个人在哪儿吗？我昨晚查了一宿，网上没有她的任何信息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yu, do you know where Zhong Yangzi is? I searched all night long and found zero trace of her online.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "据我所知，她和白石公司的合约没有任何法律效力，如果她不出来主张权利，咱们就没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From what I learned, her contract with Baishi has no legal validity — yet unless she steps forward to claim her rights, our hands are tied.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这事你是从哪儿知道的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where did you find that out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我自有我的方法，我们这些小员工也不是白痴啊！钟阳子对于这件事情的解决至关重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have my own methods — us junior staffers aren't idiots! Zhong Yangzi is vital to resolving this whole crisis.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你为什么会觉得我知道她在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why would you assume I know where she is?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你就是知道！这件事情发生了这么久，你从来都不说的人，就是你想保护的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because you do know! Through this whole crisis you never once mentioned her — the person you never name is the person you want to protect.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我私人去找她，不会有那么多媒体关注到我。我发誓不会伤害到任何人，你相信我！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll visit her privately without going through the company so the media won't notice me. I swear nobody will get hurt — trust me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在有空吗？能不能陪我去趟日本？那就在我们家门口见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you free right now? Could you accompany me on a quick trip to Japan? Let's meet right outside my building!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总在吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在倒是在，你要不怕死的话，你就进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我什么时候怕死过？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您知道钟阳子这个人在哪儿吗？我昨晚查了一宿，网上没有她的任何信息。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "据我所知，她和白石公司的合约没有任何法律效力，如果她不出来主张权利，咱们就没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这事你是从哪儿知道的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我自有我的方法，我们这些小员工也不是白痴啊！钟阳子对于这件事情的解决至关重要。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你为什么会觉得我知道她在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你就是知道！这件事情发生了这么久，你从来都不说的人，就是你想保护的人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我私人去找她，不会有那么多媒体关注到我。我发誓不会伤害到任何人，你相信我！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在有空吗？能不能陪我去趟日本？那就在我们家门口见！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moved by Xiaogu's insight that he stays silent about the people he wishes to protect—and trusting her promise to travel privately without drawing reporters—Yuqiao gives her the address abroad. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
